WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 35=

5
01:40.780 --> 01:43.020
(Ganlu Hall)

6
01:50.900 --> 01:51.260
Your Majesty.

7
01:52.100 --> 01:53.700
You look well today.

8
01:54.340 --> 01:55.140
Do you...

9
01:58.100 --> 01:58.540
Do you

10
01:58.780 --> 02:01.340
want your grandson for company?

11
02:07.140 --> 02:07.540
No.

12
02:10.460 --> 02:11.620
Not today.

13
02:18.860 --> 02:20.100
Bring me the brush and ink.

14
02:22.380 --> 02:24.180
I'll dictate. You write.

15
02:26.540 --> 02:30.020
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

16
02:33.180 --> 02:35.500
I have borne our ancestors' burden

17
02:35.980 --> 02:38.860
for 41 years.

18
02:39.460 --> 02:39.980
(Imperial edict of succession!)

19
02:42.620 --> 02:43.820
There has been much warfare,

20
02:44.620 --> 02:46.540
yet the realm has grown more peaceful.

21
02:48.340 --> 02:49.660
Floods and droughts persist,

22
02:50.180 --> 02:51.580
yet the granaries have not run empty.

23
02:53.220 --> 02:56.260
All this is thanks to my ministers' aid.

24
02:57.100 --> 02:58.540
How could my meager virtue

25
02:59.020 --> 03:00.260
have brought this about?

26
03:02.420 --> 03:03.660
Crown Prince Mu Xun...

27
03:06.900 --> 03:07.700
(It's the Crown Prince!)

28
03:09.900 --> 03:11.180
He is the legitimate heir,

29
03:11.900 --> 03:13.340
blessed with Heaven-given wisdom.

30
03:20.740 --> 03:22.100
Why have you stopped writing?

31
03:23.260 --> 03:23.780
I...

32
03:24.300 --> 03:25.260
I thought...

33
03:26.020 --> 03:26.700
Thought what?

34
03:29.340 --> 03:31.940
You thought I'd name the Prince of Jin heir?

35
03:37.060 --> 03:39.340
He's a spineless fool.

36
03:39.980 --> 03:42.260
He's better off living in comfort.

37
03:42.860 --> 03:43.740
This throne

38
03:44.420 --> 03:45.380
is beyond his ability.

39
03:46.820 --> 03:50.180
I confined the Crown Prince and cut off his allies

40
03:50.420 --> 03:51.180
because

41
03:52.420 --> 03:53.340
all of this

42
03:54.820 --> 03:56.740
can only be given to him by me.

43
03:57.220 --> 03:57.940
He himself

44
03:58.780 --> 04:00.620
must not entertain such ambitions.

45
04:02.780 --> 04:04.620
He is too calculating.

46
04:05.020 --> 04:07.940
He needs years of hard lessons.

47
04:08.180 --> 04:08.860
It will be good for him

48
04:09.460 --> 04:11.100
and for Huai.

49
04:12.540 --> 04:14.660
He can't even handle Wanyao.

50
04:15.100 --> 04:15.620
How can I

51
04:16.380 --> 04:17.940
possibly feel at ease

52
04:18.300 --> 04:20.260
entrusting him with the empire?

53
04:23.660 --> 04:24.580
I understand.

54
04:25.260 --> 04:26.180
I'll continue writing.

55
04:28.180 --> 04:31.340
(I mend my faults and grow cautious. He shall ascend before my coffin.)

56
04:32.220 --> 04:33.100
(If Mu Xun succeeds to the throne,)

57
04:34.300 --> 04:35.140
(given his temperament,)

58
04:35.860 --> 04:37.300
(Prince of Jin, his own brother,)

59
04:38.100 --> 04:39.100
(may not survive.)

60
04:41.100 --> 04:42.580
(Chunhua may also...)

61
04:46.500 --> 04:49.420
(I mend my faults and grow cautious. He shall ascend before my coffin.)

62
05:00.140 --> 05:02.980
(Follow Han Emperor Wen's funeral rites. I entrust the realm to you.)

63
05:02.980 --> 05:03.580
Bring it here.

64
05:21.100 --> 05:22.700
(Follow Han Emperor Wen's funeral rites. I entrust the realm to you.)

65
05:27.700 --> 05:28.540
Put it away.

66
05:33.740 --> 05:34.580
This must not be disclosed.

67
05:36.660 --> 05:37.140
Yes.

68
06:07.740 --> 06:08.540
(He's fine now.)

69
06:17.060 --> 06:17.580
Miss?

70
06:18.180 --> 06:19.180
Why are you standing at the door?

71
06:28.220 --> 06:30.620
Sir, your fever was awful yesterday.

72
06:31.260 --> 06:33.300
Thankfully, it soon passed.

73
06:33.740 --> 06:35.300
Perhaps the heavy rain all night

74
06:35.420 --> 06:36.660
washed away your illness too.

75
06:39.380 --> 06:39.940
Perhaps.

76
06:40.860 --> 06:42.740
The clerk asked me to bring these over.

77
06:43.260 --> 06:44.460
But he said there's no rush.

78
06:44.940 --> 06:46.220
Wait until you've fully recovered.

79
06:47.780 --> 06:48.820
I'm well enough now.

80
06:49.500 --> 06:50.300
Read them to me.

81
06:54.340 --> 06:55.100
But

82
06:55.340 --> 06:57.900
Mr. Yang's maid brought medicine.

83
06:58.540 --> 06:59.740
Why don't you drink it first?

84
07:08.940 --> 07:09.340
All right.

85
07:10.860 --> 07:11.660
Thank you, Miss.

86
07:23.900 --> 07:25.980
Oh no. I brought the wrong things.

87
07:26.220 --> 07:27.020
This isn't the right pile.

88
07:27.540 --> 07:28.300
Sir, I'm sorry.

89
07:28.540 --> 07:29.260
I'll be right back.

90
07:29.900 --> 07:31.980
Miss, please watch over him.

91
08:05.500 --> 08:07.180
Your Highness now bears the fate of the realm.

92
08:08.740 --> 08:09.980
A small county like Lanyang

93
08:11.620 --> 08:12.900
isn't worth staying for so long.

94
08:44.620 --> 08:45.540
When did you find out?

95
08:48.580 --> 08:49.140
Was it that night?

96
08:50.460 --> 08:51.860
When I wrote on your palm?

97
08:52.740 --> 08:53.300
That night,

98
08:54.540 --> 08:55.660
I was certain it was you.

99
08:57.340 --> 08:58.380
Before that, I only suspected.

100
08:59.300 --> 09:00.380
Then why didn't you say so sooner?

101
09:06.140 --> 09:06.820
Why so silent?

102
09:09.220 --> 09:09.900
Scholar Yan,

103
09:11.060 --> 09:12.580
aren't you usually so eloquent?

104
09:29.620 --> 09:30.420
I thought

105
09:32.740 --> 09:33.980
we would never meet again.

106
09:39.980 --> 09:41.220
That you were still willing to see me

107
09:44.660 --> 09:45.500
makes me very happy.

108
09:46.140 --> 09:46.940
Happy?

109
09:51.460 --> 09:52.860
Happy that you fooled me once again,

110
09:54.540 --> 09:55.460
or do you have some other motive?

111
09:57.420 --> 09:58.100
You knew

112
09:58.980 --> 09:59.860
once the truth came out,

113
10:01.380 --> 10:02.300
I would leave at once,

114
10:03.420 --> 10:03.740
didn't you?

115
10:07.180 --> 10:08.380
Back in Lingnan,

116
10:09.380 --> 10:10.820
you had me completely fooled

117
10:12.020 --> 10:13.420
just to make me take you away.

118
10:15.820 --> 10:16.300
This time,

119
10:17.340 --> 10:18.060
what do you want?

120
10:19.940 --> 10:21.180
Now that you've lost your sight...

121
10:26.220 --> 10:27.380
Your blindness is what you deserve.

122
10:28.260 --> 10:28.980
I hope one day

123
10:29.860 --> 10:31.180
that wretched tongue of yours

124
10:31.460 --> 10:32.380
will be of no use either.

125
10:44.420 --> 10:45.020
(Shendu Hall) Then...

126
10:47.900 --> 10:48.980
When will you leave?

127
10:56.020 --> 10:56.540
Today.

128
11:25.820 --> 11:26.500
Prepare to depart.

129
11:28.660 --> 11:29.780
Must you rush so much?

130
11:44.820 --> 11:45.420
It's time to go.

131
11:46.340 --> 11:47.020
Is it because

132
11:47.500 --> 11:48.780
there's no reason to stay here anymore,

133
11:49.740 --> 11:50.420
or because

134
11:51.180 --> 11:52.620
Yan Shang finally knows who you are?

135
11:53.060 --> 11:53.700
You've overstepped!

136
11:58.180 --> 11:58.780
It's time to go.

137
12:01.260 --> 12:02.940
(While I can still be ruthless.)

138
12:21.740 --> 12:28.220
(County Office)

139
12:28.220 --> 12:28.780
Leaving already?

140
12:29.700 --> 12:30.380
Here, take this.

141
12:30.660 --> 12:31.340
I'll go help.

142
12:31.500 --> 12:31.820
All right.

143
12:33.620 --> 12:35.660
Miss, sir, are you friends of our magistrate?

144
12:37.100 --> 12:37.620
Yes.

145
12:39.060 --> 12:40.740
Come back to Lanyang when you can

146
12:41.020 --> 12:42.300
and visit our magistrate.

147
12:44.140 --> 12:46.180
(County Office)

148
12:46.180 --> 12:47.060
The magistrate is here.

149
12:54.980 --> 12:55.540
Magistrate Yan.

150
13:07.260 --> 13:07.940
What are you doing here?

151
13:08.500 --> 13:13.380
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

152
13:13.700 --> 13:14.140
Farewell,

153
13:15.020 --> 13:16.980
Your Highnesses.

154
13:18.940 --> 13:19.500
There's no need.

155
13:20.140 --> 13:21.260
You weren't here to see me off anyway.

156
13:24.860 --> 13:25.220
Wanyao.

157
13:25.220 --> 13:29.100
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

158
13:29.220 --> 13:34.940
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪ (County Office)

159
13:38.780 --> 13:39.180
Yan Shang.

160
13:41.060 --> 13:42.420
In Huai, officials are chosen

161
13:44.420 --> 13:45.380
by looks, speech, calligraphy, and judgment,

162
13:46.060 --> 13:46.860
with appearance ranked first.

163
13:48.100 --> 13:48.980
Since you are now blind,

164
13:50.140 --> 13:51.460
you should be removed as magistrate.

165
13:53.380 --> 13:54.380
But your record is commendable.

166
13:56.060 --> 13:57.980
I can make an exception for you.

167
14:00.580 --> 14:01.740
Thank you for your grace, Your Highness.

168
14:01.740 --> 14:04.500
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪ (County Office)

169
14:04.780 --> 14:09.220
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

170
14:09.220 --> 14:10.020
Go back to your duties.

171
14:10.020 --> 14:11.420
♪Not a single hour less♪

172
14:11.860 --> 14:12.460
In a few days,

173
14:13.660 --> 14:14.500
I'll send an imperial physician.

174
14:15.060 --> 14:15.820
There's no need, Your Highness.

175
14:16.100 --> 14:17.380
How dare you refuse me?

176
14:19.220 --> 14:22.660
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

177
14:22.820 --> 14:25.380
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

178
14:25.380 --> 14:26.020
I wouldn't dare.

179
14:27.100 --> 14:27.620
It's just that

180
14:28.460 --> 14:29.940
Wenji sent imperial physicians several times.

181
14:31.260 --> 14:31.860
It's no use.

182
14:32.180 --> 14:33.180
The ones he found didn't work.

183
14:33.860 --> 14:35.300
I may yet find someone who can treat you!

184
14:35.460 --> 14:38.100
♪- Dusk lights fade, flowers bloom; - May time be free of pain♪

185
14:38.580 --> 14:39.060
What are you laughing at?

186
14:39.060 --> 14:40.700
♪You're the only one I need♪

187
14:40.940 --> 14:41.820
I'm laughing at myself.

188
14:43.140 --> 14:45.500
Your Highness stayed silent for days,

189
14:46.420 --> 14:46.980
and the moment you spoke,

190
14:48.060 --> 14:48.980
all you did was scold me.

191
14:49.220 --> 14:49.860
You deserve it!

192
14:49.860 --> 14:51.340
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

193
14:51.380 --> 14:54.820
♪My last untouched innocence♪

194
15:00.180 --> 15:00.980
When we parted that day,

195
15:02.300 --> 15:04.780
I never dared hope we would meet again.

196
15:06.260 --> 15:06.700
And yet,

197
15:08.020 --> 15:08.700
in this life,

198
15:10.020 --> 15:10.980
we must part once more.

199
15:13.220 --> 15:15.060
A long road lies ahead.

200
15:15.700 --> 15:16.700
We may never meet again.

201
15:19.620 --> 15:20.580
I only wish you

202
15:21.820 --> 15:22.980
health and peace, year after year,

203
15:23.900 --> 15:24.980
and a long, blessed life.

204
15:26.900 --> 15:32.780
♪- Burning bright as a song; - See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

205
15:32.900 --> 15:37.780
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

206
15:37.860 --> 15:42.660
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

207
15:42.740 --> 15:44.540
♪Not a single hour less♪

208
15:44.580 --> 15:48.360
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

209
15:48.360 --> 15:52.340
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

210
15:52.420 --> 15:55.780
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

211
15:56.060 --> 15:59.420
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

212
15:59.620 --> 16:06.500
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

213
16:06.700 --> 16:08.580
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

214
16:08.580 --> 16:11.220
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn; - May time be free of pain♪

215
16:11.260 --> 16:13.780
♪You're the only one I need♪

216
16:13.860 --> 16:17.520
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

217
16:17.520 --> 16:21.020
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

218
16:21.100 --> 16:24.420
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

219
16:24.580 --> 16:27.940
♪My last untouched innocence♪

220
16:28.260 --> 16:31.700
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

221
16:31.980 --> 16:35.340
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

222
16:35.500 --> 16:42.380
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

223
16:42.580 --> 16:44.460
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

224
16:44.460 --> 16:47.100
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn; - May time be free of pain♪

225
16:47.220 --> 16:49.780
♪You're the only one I need♪

226
16:49.820 --> 16:52.580
♪By your side, through joy and pain♪

227
16:52.580 --> 16:56.980
♪Is that eternity?♪ (Chengfu Gate)

228
16:57.060 --> 17:00.420
♪- Till fireworks flood the town; - Till the lake is still and clear♪

229
17:00.460 --> 17:03.900
♪The wind blows past us♪

230
17:04.180 --> 17:08.780
♪- If there's still; - Some warmth left in this world♪

231
17:09.540 --> 17:14.020
♪You're the only one I need♪

232
17:16.380 --> 17:16.900
Yang Si.

233
17:19.740 --> 17:21.380
Thanks for staying these past few days.

234
17:24.180 --> 17:25.100
No need to thank me.

235
17:25.820 --> 17:26.580
It wasn't exactly my pleasure.

236
17:30.820 --> 17:32.100
Then thank you for your patience.

237
17:38.060 --> 17:38.500
Forget it.

238
17:40.020 --> 17:41.820
He was fine before. Look at him now.

239
17:43.060 --> 17:43.820
Anyone would feel sorry for him...

240
17:46.020 --> 17:47.140
Why should I hold it against him?

241
17:55.900 --> 17:57.320
(I'm ignorant and know little, yet I've studied how rulers govern.)

242
17:57.320 --> 17:58.620
(The principles are all laid out. None in history rivals your foresight.)

243
18:18.860 --> 18:20.890
(Thus, humbly, I offer my limited thoughts and observations.)

244
18:20.890 --> 18:22.780
(Though unworthy of Your Majesty's grace, I submit what may be of value.)

245
18:30.500 --> 18:31.300
Once we're back in Sheng'an,

246
18:32.020 --> 18:33.620
we'll seek a renowned eye doctor.

247
18:34.220 --> 18:35.100
There may yet be a way.

248
19:14.140 --> 19:14.620
Easy.

249
19:15.180 --> 19:15.900
Don't splash them.

250
19:16.260 --> 19:16.620
Yes.

251
19:31.020 --> 19:31.460
Mother!

252
19:31.820 --> 19:32.220
Mother!

253
19:32.620 --> 19:33.020
Mother!

254
19:33.940 --> 19:34.420
Stop the carriage!

255
19:40.900 --> 19:41.340
Doctor!

256
19:41.740 --> 19:42.060
Quick!

257
19:42.540 --> 19:42.940
Doctor!

258
19:43.620 --> 19:43.900
Here!

259
19:44.220 --> 19:44.660
Lay her down here.

260
19:50.020 --> 19:50.500
Mother.

261
20:11.300 --> 20:11.940
Thank you, Doctor!

262
20:12.260 --> 20:12.980
Thank you, Doctor!

263
20:13.260 --> 20:13.980
- Please, get up. - Thank you.

264
20:14.100 --> 20:15.060
A miracle worker!

265
20:19.860 --> 20:20.300
Mother.

266
20:21.340 --> 20:21.700
Mother.

267
20:26.500 --> 20:27.380
Sir, may I ask

268
20:28.340 --> 20:29.940
what this elderly woman's illness is?

269
20:30.460 --> 20:31.180
It's not an illness.

270
20:31.700 --> 20:32.900
The weather has been suddenly hot and cold lately.

271
20:33.380 --> 20:34.540
She was likely caught in the rain

272
20:34.780 --> 20:35.660
and has overexerted herself.

273
20:36.060 --> 20:36.780
Her breath has become disordered,

274
20:37.300 --> 20:38.740
and Yin and Yang no longer harmonize.

275
20:39.020 --> 20:40.060
That's what caused her fainting spell.

276
20:40.700 --> 20:41.580
Lately,

277
20:42.260 --> 20:43.660
I've seen many patients like this.

278
20:44.460 --> 20:44.740
Yes.

279
20:44.900 --> 20:45.180
That's right.

280
20:46.060 --> 20:46.820
She was indeed caught in the rain.

281
20:47.660 --> 20:48.180
Thank you, Doctor.

282
20:48.500 --> 20:49.060
There's no need to worry.

283
20:49.460 --> 20:50.540
She just needs to rest at home.

284
20:51.020 --> 20:51.300
All right.

285
20:51.620 --> 20:52.140
Dear!

286
20:53.420 --> 20:55.140
Our stored herbs are nearly gone.

287
20:56.540 --> 20:59.460
Let's buy more herbs in town soon.

288
21:00.220 --> 21:00.820
Get some rest.

289
21:00.980 --> 21:01.660
I'll go tomorrow.

290
21:06.860 --> 21:07.980
You heal the sick, give out medicine,

291
21:08.740 --> 21:09.620
and help the poor.

292
21:09.620 --> 21:10.300
That's truly admirable.

293
21:11.140 --> 21:12.020
May I ask your names?

294
21:12.220 --> 21:12.620
You're too kind.

295
21:12.620 --> 21:13.900
(Lin Dao, son of Prefect Lin Chuan; Liu Ruozhu, Chancellor Liu's daughter)

296
21:13.900 --> 21:14.540
I'm Lin Dao.

297
21:15.620 --> 21:16.220
My wife is surnamed Liu.

298
21:18.700 --> 21:19.220
Lin Dao?

299
21:21.100 --> 21:22.940
Is Yuezhou Prefect Lin Chuan your father?

300
21:23.220 --> 21:23.660
Yes.

301
21:24.620 --> 21:25.580
How did you know, Miss?

302
21:27.900 --> 21:28.700
This lady

303
21:29.140 --> 21:30.300
must be Chancellor Liu's daughter.

304
21:37.860 --> 21:39.060
I failed to recognize Your Highness.

305
21:39.620 --> 21:40.340
I was discourteous just now.

306
21:41.620 --> 21:42.740
Her Highness is traveling incognito.

307
21:43.340 --> 21:44.740
Please don't reveal her identity, sir.

308
21:45.700 --> 21:46.060
Please, sit.

309
21:46.820 --> 21:47.260
I understand.

310
21:47.820 --> 21:48.540
Rest assured.

311
21:49.740 --> 21:50.020
Sit.

312
21:54.900 --> 21:56.140
I've heard that Chancellor Liu

313
21:56.580 --> 21:57.700
considered Sheng'an's finest young men.

314
21:58.300 --> 22:00.900
In the end, Ms. Liu chose Mr. Lin

315
22:01.340 --> 22:02.180
as her husband.

316
22:03.180 --> 22:03.980
Seeing you today,

317
22:04.500 --> 22:05.380
I can say Chancellor Liu chose well.

318
22:06.300 --> 22:07.340
I'm fortunate that my wife accepted me.

319
22:08.420 --> 22:10.580
The Lin family has many officials,

320
22:11.460 --> 22:13.380
and their Tianshui Library holds many books,

321
22:13.660 --> 22:14.500
making it renowned among scholars.

322
22:15.100 --> 22:16.780
You, too, are known for your talent.

323
22:17.740 --> 22:19.980
Why not take the exams and serve?

324
22:20.460 --> 22:21.340
Life is brief,

325
22:21.540 --> 22:22.340
and everyone has their own aspirations.

326
22:23.220 --> 22:24.340
The Lin clan has many sons.

327
22:24.780 --> 22:25.860
It doesn't need me to enter civil service.

328
22:26.420 --> 22:28.060
Your Highness is promoting the exams.

329
22:28.420 --> 22:30.700
Scholars abound across the realm.

330
22:31.260 --> 22:31.700
Huai

331
22:32.220 --> 22:33.780
has enough scholars already.

332
22:34.780 --> 22:36.860
I've never met a noble-born man

333
22:37.500 --> 22:38.460
whose ambition was to practice medicine.

334
22:40.580 --> 22:41.260
To be honest, Your Highness,

335
22:42.460 --> 22:43.740
I loved reading as a child,

336
22:44.220 --> 22:45.620
but I mostly read history and classics.

337
22:45.740 --> 22:46.500
I paid little heed to worldly affairs.

338
22:47.100 --> 22:47.620
Later,

339
22:48.300 --> 22:49.500
I traveled far and wide with my books.

340
22:50.100 --> 22:52.340
I saw what happened to local families.

341
22:53.100 --> 22:54.660
If one falls seriously ill,

342
22:56.220 --> 22:57.540
the family often spend all they have,

343
22:57.780 --> 22:59.060
yet still lose their loved one.

344
22:59.620 --> 23:00.380
That's when I realized

345
23:01.020 --> 23:01.900
though a physician holds a humble rank,

346
23:02.500 --> 23:03.340
they can save lives.

347
23:03.980 --> 23:05.420
Our home has thousands of books,

348
23:05.780 --> 23:07.100
but only the healing arts

349
23:07.660 --> 23:09.340
can ease the people's suffering.

350
23:13.140 --> 23:14.380
You are fortunate to have a wife

351
23:14.660 --> 23:16.380
who'll travel with you through hardship, treating patients wherever you go.

352
23:17.340 --> 23:18.300
Is that

353
23:18.780 --> 23:19.940
your passion too, Ms. Liu?

354
23:20.780 --> 23:21.860
I enjoy collecting old books,

355
23:22.460 --> 23:24.380
especially books on music and Go.

356
23:25.340 --> 23:26.260
I travel with my husband,

357
23:26.860 --> 23:27.740
helping him treat patients,

358
23:28.260 --> 23:29.580
and he searches for old books for me

359
23:30.260 --> 23:31.100
without sparing himself any effort.

360
23:31.940 --> 23:32.980
Unfortunately,

361
23:33.620 --> 23:34.620
I cannot see.

362
23:35.460 --> 23:36.500
Otherwise, along the way,

363
23:37.180 --> 23:38.700
I could help you with so much more.

364
23:39.380 --> 23:40.420
Ms. Liu, your eyes...

365
23:42.540 --> 23:43.580
With Lin Dao's medical skills,

366
23:44.380 --> 23:45.380
there's still nothing he can do?

367
23:47.300 --> 23:48.420
He's done all he can.

368
23:49.460 --> 23:52.260
But I've been this way since birth.

369
23:53.180 --> 23:54.900
My father sought renowned physicians

370
23:55.220 --> 23:56.100
but nothing helped.

371
23:56.660 --> 23:57.260
My husband

372
23:57.900 --> 23:59.660
had read every medical book in Tianshui Library.

373
24:00.580 --> 24:02.660
We've traveled far and wide,

374
24:03.220 --> 24:04.660
seeking remedies across the land.

375
24:05.420 --> 24:06.100
Sadly,

376
24:07.060 --> 24:08.140
none has worked.

377
24:09.180 --> 24:10.220
This congenital blindness

378
24:12.060 --> 24:13.500
is indeed beyond the reach of medicine.

379
24:18.700 --> 24:19.260
Last year,

380
24:20.180 --> 24:20.900
while staying in the Shu region,

381
24:22.220 --> 24:24.260
I treated two patients who had been blind for a long time.

382
24:25.260 --> 24:27.460
They regained their sight after acupuncture.

383
24:28.940 --> 24:29.460
Unfortunately,

384
24:31.220 --> 24:33.900
the same technique did not suit my wife.

385
24:35.300 --> 24:36.980
I only made you suffer needlessly.

386
24:37.300 --> 24:38.060
Don't worry.

387
24:41.460 --> 24:42.060
Mr. Lin,

388
24:44.180 --> 24:45.060
I'd like you

389
24:45.820 --> 24:46.660
to see a patient.

390
24:55.340 --> 24:55.780
Coming.

391
25:12.860 --> 25:13.500
Who's outside?

392
25:15.220 --> 25:16.140
Your eyes can't see,

393
25:16.620 --> 25:17.500
yet you'll open the door to anyone?

394
25:18.260 --> 25:19.540
Have you no sense of caution?

395
25:21.780 --> 25:22.700
Donglang was fast asleep.

396
25:25.060 --> 25:25.540
Why are you...

397
25:35.780 --> 25:39.460
(Shendu Hall)

398
25:39.460 --> 25:40.380
From what I can tell,

399
25:41.500 --> 25:43.260
his blindness is from poison.

400
25:43.460 --> 25:44.300
It blocks the eye channels.

401
25:45.140 --> 25:46.740
First, needle the point,

402
25:47.220 --> 25:49.060
then shield his eyes with healing gauze.

403
25:49.740 --> 25:51.500
His sight may return. There's hope.

404
25:52.580 --> 25:53.740
But this method of acupuncture

405
25:56.220 --> 25:57.420
may cause him some pain.

406
25:58.140 --> 25:59.180
What are the chances of success?

407
26:02.940 --> 26:03.420
Thirty percent.

408
26:05.260 --> 26:07.060
Even ten percent would be worth trying.

409
26:08.580 --> 26:08.900
Please.

410
26:12.740 --> 26:13.980
Your Highness decided for me

411
26:14.660 --> 26:15.900
as if these were your own eyes.

412
26:16.100 --> 26:16.620
They are mine!

413
26:17.220 --> 26:18.460
Even your life is mine! Remember that!

414
26:25.260 --> 26:29.500
(Shendu Hall)

415
26:53.980 --> 26:54.540
Dr. Lin.

416
27:04.340 --> 27:04.780
Yan Shang!

417
27:11.220 --> 27:11.820
It's all right.

418
27:12.980 --> 27:13.460
That's it.

419
27:23.020 --> 27:23.780
How do you feel?

420
27:33.980 --> 27:35.020
Can't you see even a glimmer?

421
27:36.740 --> 27:37.220
No.

422
27:44.180 --> 27:44.660
I'm sorry.

423
27:45.260 --> 27:46.100
It seems this treatment

424
27:47.740 --> 27:48.780
isn't right for you either.

425
27:51.980 --> 27:52.460
Don't take it off.

426
27:54.860 --> 27:55.340
Your Highness.

427
28:01.060 --> 28:01.900
Thank you for your efforts, Dr. Lin.

428
28:02.980 --> 28:03.780
I appreciate

429
28:04.740 --> 28:05.660
your kindness.

430
28:06.460 --> 28:07.500
I'll keep searching.

431
28:08.420 --> 28:09.620
I believe there's a cure.

432
28:11.140 --> 28:11.620
Mr. Yan,

433
28:12.300 --> 28:13.100
sorry to disturb you so late.

434
28:14.340 --> 28:14.780
We'll take our leave.

435
28:15.140 --> 28:15.580
(Shendu Hall) Wait.

436
28:16.380 --> 28:17.460
Dr. Lin, you've traveled for days.

437
28:18.340 --> 28:19.060
Why not

438
28:19.500 --> 28:20.500
stay here tonight with your wife?

439
29:04.340 --> 29:05.140
Why don't you light the lamp?

440
29:06.100 --> 29:07.060
The lamp oil

441
29:07.740 --> 29:09.180
is where I can save.

442
29:09.540 --> 29:10.220
But I don't like this!

443
29:31.140 --> 29:32.180
I hate seeing you

444
29:33.660 --> 29:35.220
grope through life in the dark.

445
29:37.980 --> 29:38.460
Your Highness.

446
29:39.700 --> 29:41.180
I've grown used to it.

447
29:42.220 --> 29:43.100
In my daily life,

448
29:43.860 --> 29:44.900
it causes me little trouble.

449
29:45.580 --> 29:47.300
Not a word you say pleases me.

450
29:48.500 --> 29:50.300
Not like when you wooed me, Yan Shang.

451
29:52.980 --> 29:54.060
If that's all you have to say,

452
29:54.460 --> 29:55.100
then don't say it.

453
29:57.820 --> 29:59.140
I was doing it on purpose, actually.

454
30:03.060 --> 30:04.140
I let the brush slip on purpose.

455
30:12.140 --> 30:12.820
The truth is,

456
30:14.260 --> 30:15.900
I knew you shouldn't come back.

457
30:17.140 --> 30:18.140
But you did.

458
30:19.580 --> 30:20.940
And I'm overjoyed.

459
30:23.100 --> 30:24.260
When I woke this morning,

460
30:25.660 --> 30:26.540
your hair

461
30:27.460 --> 30:28.500
brushed against my face.

462
30:30.220 --> 30:31.460
I was filled with joy.

463
30:38.220 --> 30:38.940
The truth is...

464
30:41.580 --> 30:42.460
I'm scared.

465
30:43.660 --> 30:44.580
Because even in my dreams,

466
30:45.900 --> 30:46.540
your face

467
30:48.260 --> 30:49.540
is starting to fade.

468
30:51.460 --> 30:52.060
If...

469
30:53.660 --> 30:54.780
I could see you once more,

470
30:56.740 --> 30:57.820
I'd remember it all.

471
30:58.980 --> 31:00.380
Every detail of your face.

472
31:02.100 --> 31:02.620
If...

473
32:15.580 --> 32:17.300
If only I'd met Lin Dao sooner,

474
32:18.260 --> 32:18.860
that would've been better.

475
32:22.060 --> 32:23.940
He may not have cured your eyes,

476
32:24.980 --> 32:26.220
but he cured your tongue.

477
32:49.140 --> 32:54.860
(County Office)

478
32:55.420 --> 32:55.820
Mr. Yan.

479
32:56.540 --> 32:56.940
We'll take our leave.

480
32:59.740 --> 33:00.980
Dr. Lin, Ms. Liu,

481
33:01.780 --> 33:03.180
if you ever pass through Lanyang again,

482
33:03.620 --> 33:05.220
please do visit my home.

483
33:08.220 --> 33:09.420
Thank you for the kind invitation.

484
33:09.940 --> 33:10.700
But

485
33:10.980 --> 33:13.460
we'll visit an old friend in Youzhou,

486
33:14.060 --> 33:16.620
then head south to seek ancient books

487
33:16.820 --> 33:17.660
and treat patients along the way.

488
33:18.700 --> 33:19.100
Yes.

489
33:19.700 --> 33:20.980
We don't know when we'll return.

490
33:23.300 --> 33:24.820
To have each other wherever you roam,

491
33:26.060 --> 33:27.100
you needn't envy any other couple.

492
33:28.580 --> 33:29.540
Your Highness and the Prince Consort, too...

493
33:38.100 --> 33:39.700
Your Highness, gentlemen,

494
33:40.660 --> 33:41.580
until we meet again.

495
33:43.980 --> 33:45.140
Until we meet again.

496
33:45.140 --> 33:46.100
(County Office)

497
33:46.100 --> 33:46.460
Dear.

498
33:47.140 --> 33:47.500
Let's go.

499
33:57.140 --> 34:00.460
(Chengfu Gate)

500
34:00.460 --> 34:04.180
(County Office)

501
34:04.180 --> 34:05.540
You've gone to great trouble for me.

502
34:05.820 --> 34:06.860
I have no way to repay you.

503
34:08.100 --> 34:11.140
The Ghost Festival is on in town today.

504
34:11.500 --> 34:11.860
I wonder if you two...

505
34:11.860 --> 34:12.420
I'll pass.

506
34:13.740 --> 34:15.020
Where's a good tavern in Lanyang?

507
34:15.460 --> 34:16.060
I'd like a drink or two.

508
34:17.540 --> 34:18.060
Yang Si.

509
34:18.260 --> 34:18.620
What?

510
34:19.220 --> 34:21.260
Do you want to drink me under the table?

511
34:24.660 --> 34:24.980
Donglang.

512
34:25.180 --> 34:26.220
He can't drink.

513
34:26.540 --> 34:27.540
I'll take you to a good tavern.

514
34:28.100 --> 34:28.420
Come on.

515
34:28.980 --> 34:29.340
Let's go.

516
34:30.060 --> 34:30.340
Go.

517
34:30.340 --> 34:32.380
(County Office)

518
34:35.140 --> 34:35.700
Go on.

519
34:36.500 --> 34:37.420
What about the Ghost Festival?

520
34:38.500 --> 34:39.460
The Ghost Festival in Lanyang...

521
34:41.620 --> 34:42.060
Are you okay?

522
34:50.740 --> 34:51.460
There's nothing serious.

523
34:52.300 --> 34:54.300
I just had a sudden headache.

524
34:54.820 --> 34:55.460
It's gone now.

525
34:58.300 --> 35:00.020
Did Dr. Lin botch the treatment?

526
35:02.580 --> 35:04.220
We should have kept him here longer,

527
35:05.300 --> 35:06.500
so he could try a few more methods

528
35:07.060 --> 35:07.780
and put you through more suffering.

529
35:11.020 --> 35:13.020
Then I'll go bring him back.

530
35:14.060 --> 35:14.660
Come back.

531
35:16.020 --> 35:18.060
Drive evil spirits away! Light the way!

532
35:18.900 --> 35:22.420
Come see our latest scented sachets!

533
35:30.060 --> 35:31.820
Sugar figurines! Come buy!

534
35:32.700 --> 35:33.860
Sugar figurines!

535
35:43.420 --> 35:43.860
Magistrate Yan!

536
35:43.860 --> 35:44.700
Come again if you like them!

537
35:45.500 --> 35:46.300
I'll take these two.

538
35:46.300 --> 35:47.580
Scented sachets!

539
35:48.580 --> 35:50.660
Freshly made sachets! Have a look!

540
35:50.660 --> 35:52.420
Magistrate Yan, out for the festival?

541
35:52.940 --> 35:53.620
Magistrate Yan.

542
35:54.140 --> 35:55.740
Who's this lady beside you?

543
35:55.820 --> 35:56.820
She's quite beautiful!

544
35:58.620 --> 36:00.260
Here, take this lantern.

545
36:05.060 --> 36:05.460
Thank you.

546
36:06.460 --> 36:06.860
Thank you.

547
36:07.820 --> 36:08.100
Let's go.

548
36:08.140 --> 36:08.460
Come on.

549
36:11.580 --> 36:14.780
Drive evil spirits away! Light the way!

550
36:14.820 --> 36:15.700
On your right,

551
36:16.020 --> 36:18.740
there are little potted fruit trees.

552
36:19.540 --> 36:22.100
They're made of bamboo strips and colored paper.

553
36:23.020 --> 36:24.580
Lanterns made from mugwort stalks!

554
36:28.700 --> 36:29.380
It's a shadow-puppet show.

555
36:31.620 --> 36:32.060
Yes.

556
36:32.340 --> 36:32.740
Hit him!

557
36:33.060 --> 36:33.860
Well done!

558
36:33.860 --> 36:34.300
Wonderful!

559
36:34.580 --> 36:34.980
Wonderful!

560
36:34.980 --> 36:36.060
We never tire of watching this!

561
36:40.100 --> 36:41.540
Lanyang's lanterns are fascinating.

562
36:42.460 --> 36:43.740
I've never seen these in Sheng'an.

563
36:45.220 --> 36:46.140
What do they look like?

564
36:47.740 --> 36:48.620
Like stars,

565
36:49.140 --> 36:49.980
twinkling in the night.

566
36:51.260 --> 36:52.180
They must be beautiful.

567
36:57.300 --> 36:58.140
It's lively up ahead.

568
36:58.900 --> 37:00.140
A rite for wandering spirits, it seems.

569
37:01.420 --> 37:01.980
Let's go take a look.

570
37:09.620 --> 37:10.380
Beautiful!

571
37:10.820 --> 37:11.860
It's so beautiful!

572
37:13.460 --> 37:14.300
(Chengfu Gate) Wonderful!

573
37:15.380 --> 37:15.900
One more!

574
37:16.300 --> 37:17.420
Wonderful!

575
37:18.740 --> 37:19.300
Beautiful!

576
37:19.300 --> 37:20.380
One more!

577
37:21.220 --> 37:22.780
One more!

578
37:23.260 --> 37:23.860
Beautiful!

579
37:26.260 --> 37:27.580
Wonderful!

580
37:28.340 --> 37:29.180
One more!

581
37:29.380 --> 37:30.140
Another one!

582
37:30.540 --> 37:31.500
That's gorgeous!

583
37:32.700 --> 37:36.540
Wonderful! Wonderful!

584
37:37.500 --> 37:38.140
So beautiful!

585
37:41.260 --> 37:42.020
One more!

586
37:44.900 --> 37:45.620
This is fascinating.

587
37:46.500 --> 37:47.500
The living share a lively celebration,

588
37:48.300 --> 37:49.740
yet it's all to comfort the departed

589
37:50.100 --> 37:50.940
and guide the spirits to rest.

590
37:52.140 --> 37:52.540
Yan Shang.

591
37:53.300 --> 37:54.620
Have you thought about life and death?

592
37:56.260 --> 37:57.300
I did when I was young.

593
37:57.860 --> 37:59.700
I hoped my loved ones watched over me,

594
38:00.180 --> 38:01.420
yet feared they might never find peace.

595
38:02.780 --> 38:03.660
I no longer think about it.

596
38:04.380 --> 38:05.500
Life lasts no more than 30,000 days.

597
38:06.300 --> 38:08.380
We start naive, end frail and confused,

598
38:08.980 --> 38:09.940
and face danger, worry, and illness.

599
38:11.100 --> 38:12.140
The time we have to accomplish anything

600
38:12.620 --> 38:13.620
amounts to only a few decades.

601
38:14.620 --> 38:15.220
Every day we live

602
38:15.860 --> 38:16.940
must be spent on something worthwhile.

603
38:17.620 --> 38:18.660
Doesn't living like that wear you out?

604
38:19.900 --> 38:20.780
The world is but a waystation,

605
38:21.060 --> 38:21.860
and all things share one home.

606
38:22.740 --> 38:24.420
In the end, everything turns to dust.

607
38:25.420 --> 38:27.580
So we should live freely and fully while we can

608
38:28.540 --> 38:29.300
and achieve what we set our minds to.

609
38:30.020 --> 38:30.620
Once we're dead,

610
38:31.060 --> 38:32.180
there'll be no chance to do anything.

611
38:33.140 --> 38:34.180
What is it Your Highness wants?

612
38:34.980 --> 38:35.900
There is much I want.

613
38:36.620 --> 38:37.660
So no matter what,

614
38:37.940 --> 38:39.020
I must live well

615
38:39.580 --> 38:40.500
and pursue all that I seek.

616
38:43.660 --> 38:44.580
Then I wish Your Highness

617
38:45.380 --> 38:46.340
every success.

618
38:47.500 --> 38:49.580
Then I thank you for those kind words.

619
38:54.980 --> 38:55.540
Who is she?

620
38:55.660 --> 38:56.020
Who is it?

621
38:56.020 --> 38:56.340
Who?

622
38:56.700 --> 38:57.060
Who is it?

623
38:57.180 --> 38:57.740
Who is she?

624
38:58.380 --> 38:58.980
Magistrate Yan,

625
38:59.700 --> 39:01.780
we should find somewhere quieter to sit.

626
39:02.700 --> 39:04.020
If we keep drawing this much attention,

627
39:04.420 --> 39:04.940
I'm afraid

628
39:05.700 --> 39:06.740
it could ruin your reputation.

629
39:08.580 --> 39:09.820
As Your Highness wishes.

630
39:21.660 --> 39:28.560
(Chengfu Gate)

631
39:58.220 --> 39:59.180
When are you going back?

632
40:06.460 --> 40:07.580
Would you like to hear the truth

633
40:08.620 --> 40:09.380
or a lie?

634
40:12.900 --> 40:13.420
The truth.

635
40:14.860 --> 40:15.740
Princess Danyang

636
40:16.860 --> 40:17.740
has no need to lie.

637
40:19.340 --> 40:19.860
Tomorrow.

638
40:27.500 --> 40:33.380
(Chengfu Gate)

639
40:35.820 --> 40:36.180
All right.

640
40:38.180 --> 40:38.820
I'll see you off.

641
40:45.420 --> 40:46.300
I also have a lie.

642
40:46.940 --> 40:47.540
Would you like to hear it?

643
40:50.420 --> 40:50.820
All right.

644
40:53.100 --> 40:53.900
I'm not going back.

645
40:55.820 --> 40:56.980
Every day from now on,

646
40:57.620 --> 40:58.260
and every night,

647
40:59.940 --> 41:01.180
we'll stay just as we are now.

648
41:02.740 --> 41:03.740
Together,

649
41:05.020 --> 41:06.140
hand in hand,

650
41:07.060 --> 41:08.420
sharing the ordinary chores of life.

651
41:09.700 --> 41:10.380
And in the end,

652
41:11.020 --> 41:12.460
we'll grow old and become

653
41:13.380 --> 41:14.340
a couple with grey hair.

654
41:21.580 --> 41:21.980
All right.

655
41:25.260 --> 41:26.620
Tonight, is it that whatever I say,

656
41:27.340 --> 41:28.100
you'll agree with me?

657
41:36.220 --> 41:36.660
Yan Shang.

658
41:39.060 --> 41:40.300
Come back to Sheng'an with me.

659
41:49.620 --> 41:50.100
Your Highness.

660
41:53.500 --> 41:53.980
I...

661
42:00.060 --> 42:00.540
Yan Shang!

662
42:01.220 --> 42:01.940
Yan Shang, what's wrong?

663
42:02.420 --> 42:02.780
Yan Shang!

664
42:05.620 --> 42:06.060
Yan Shang!

665
42:07.140 --> 42:07.620
Yan Shang!

666
42:11.220 --> 42:11.700
Yan Shang!

667
43:56.820 --> 43:57.260
Your Highness.

668
43:59.860 --> 44:00.620
Tonight,

669
44:03.900 --> 44:04.940
you look truly beautiful.

670
44:08.380 --> 44:08.980
Yan Shang.

671
44:11.620 --> 44:12.940
You really are impossible!

672
44:15.100 --> 44:15.660
